WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.158 --> 00:00:04.587
(suspenseful music)

00:00:05.455 --> 00:00:08.375
- On March 25th, 2015, the world learned

00:00:08.375 --> 00:00:11.586
that Zayn Malik left
the band One Direction,

00:00:11.586 --> 00:00:14.589
and from our perspective at
BuzzFeed, the Internet exploded

00:00:14.589 --> 00:00:17.175
with the grief of teenagers everywhere.

00:00:17.175 --> 00:00:18.677
We hit the streets of Hollywood

00:00:18.677 --> 00:00:21.296
to find out how people reacted.

00:00:21.296 --> 00:00:23.557
Zayn Malik left the band One Direction.

00:00:23.557 --> 00:00:25.058
- (gasps) Oh, I heard that!

00:00:25.058 --> 00:00:26.487
(guys laugh)
That was real?

00:00:26.487 --> 00:00:27.635
- Oh, dear.

00:00:27.635 --> 00:00:29.980
- You know, I feel like we
all knew something like this

00:00:29.980 --> 00:00:31.398
is going to happen at some point.

00:00:31.398 --> 00:00:32.440
- A plus!

00:00:32.440 --> 00:00:33.553
(girls laugh)
Good job!

00:00:33.553 --> 00:00:35.444
- I don't mind, because
he looks pretty bored

00:00:35.444 --> 00:00:37.070
on stage all the time anyway, so.

00:00:37.070 --> 00:00:38.363
- I don't know. I kind of understand

00:00:38.363 --> 00:00:40.282
how the artist, they grow apart.

00:00:40.282 --> 00:00:42.868
- He left in One Direction? Was it down?

00:00:42.868 --> 00:00:44.433
- Uhm, well --

00:00:45.125 --> 00:00:46.142
What was his name again?

00:00:47.527 --> 00:00:48.511
- No. (laughs)

00:00:49.124 --> 00:00:50.083
- No.

00:00:50.083 --> 00:00:51.209
- Nope.

00:00:51.209 --> 00:00:52.378
- It happens.
- It doesn't hurt the group.

00:00:52.378 --> 00:00:54.546
- I'm sure he made a
lot of money from One --

00:00:54.546 --> 00:00:55.527
One Direction?

00:00:57.704 --> 00:01:00.747
Well, being a normal 22 year old, I'm 22,

00:01:01.500 --> 00:01:03.013
I don't really know what that even means.

00:01:03.013 --> 00:01:07.442
(rock music)

00:01:08.129 --> 00:01:10.195
- Zayn needs to think about Zayn.

